    "details": {
      "alignment": "Neutral",
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — Mr. T.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, generated from the article's own words. no XP ledger entry; archetype default → CR 1 as a operative. Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>The Courier Who Cleans the Laundry</strong> — Wario's Enterprise / Waluigi's Audit Desk (Courier &amp; Back-Room Cleaner)</p><p>Status: Active — followed Wario and the Contract of Accord into the Star Hill corridor on 3 Aethel, 1035 BF after watching Beta Luigi walk out with an Archive Hall volume</p><p>A gaunt, exhausted courier and back-room bookkeeper who writes Wario's daily reports, cleans Waluigi's financial laundry, and knows too much about both men's gambling debts. He slid Waluigi the 'Wario Bowser / Wawario' lyric sheet, fell asleep beneath the Archive Hall's leaking vault, pulled Wario's real backup ledgers off the shelf at random, and proved he had flagged the Treasury of Wonders discrepancy months earlier with 'AUDIT REQUIRED - WARIO' in the corner.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Dagger</strong> — “The Courier Who Cleans the Laundry”</li><li><strong>Keen Records</strong> — “He opens the night of 3 Aethel, 1035 BF by sliding a transcribed song sheet across the Archive Hall table to Waluigi — &quot;Mario, Luigi, Wario, Waluigi, Bowser, and Wario Bowser&quot; — and pressing him deadpan on whether”</li><li><strong>Courier's Pace</strong> — “The Courier Who Cleans the Laundry”</li><li><strong>Coin Sense</strong> — “A gaunt, exhausted courier and back-room bookkeeper who writes Wario's daily reports, cleans Waluigi's financial laundry, and knows too much about both men's gambling debts.”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/mr_t</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/mr_t</code>.</p><p><em>Promoted from an NPC statblock to a player character sheet on 2026-11-20 (Waluipedia sheets suite). Rogue 5 (Thief), Human, background Courier.</em></p><ul><li>Rogue (Thief) read off the record: the courier who moves fast, keeps records and has a sense for coin.</li><li>Level 5, the party's level (Waluigi 5, Wario 6); Mr. T has no XP ledger row.</li><li>Standard array: DEX 15, INT 14, WIS 13, CON 12, STR 10, CHA 8.</li><li>Saving throws DEX and INT (Rogue); skills Stealth, Sleight of Hand, Investigation, Perception (class), Athletics, Insight (background).</li></ul>",
        "public": ""
      },
